-DBSYSDIC                          00000+Z0000215710                                          at the DDA-services              0                                          System-defaults.                 0       6 SAG-PRD-LOW-DES                  Fields with this keyword can     0                                          be written in lower case,        0                                          depending on the switch          0                                          'Upper/Lower-case of Descrip-    0                                          tion' at the DDA-services        0                                          System-defaults.                 0       7 SAG-PRD-LOW-HDR                  Fields with this keyword can     0                                          be written in lower case,        0                                          depending on the switch          0                                          'Upper/Lower-case of NATURAL     0                                          header' at the DDA-services      0                                          System-defaults.                 0       8 SAG-PRD-LOW-MASK                 Fields with this keyword can     0                                          be written in lower case,        0                                          depending on the switch          0                                          'Upper/Lower-case of Edit        0                                          mask' at the DDA-services        0                                          System-defaults.
-DBSYSDIC                          00000+Z0000305830       9 SAG-PRD-LOW-OBJ                  Fields with this keyword can     0                                          be written in lower case,        0                                          depending on the switch          0                                          'Upper/Lower-case of Object      0                                          id' at the DDA-services          0                                          System-defaults.                 0      10 SAG-PRD-META                     files, fields with this keyword
-DBSYSDIC                          00000+Z0000415710                                          are used in the meta data main-  0                                          tenance.                         0      11 SAG-PRD-NSC                      PREDICT attributes with this     0                                          keyword are only valid, if       0                                          NATURAL SECURITY is installed.   0      12 SAG-PRD-PCA                      PREDICT objects with this key-   0                                          word are protected in PREDICT    0                                          if the file/field is generated   0                                          by PREDICT-CASE.                 0      13 SAG-PRD-R-HARD                   Fields with this keyword are     0                                          rippled from a masterfile        0                                          (= ADABAS, VSAM...) to its       0                                          related userviews.               0                                          The fields are always rippled.   0      14 SAG-PRD-R-SOFT                   Fields with this keyword are     0                                          rippled from a masterfile        0                                          (= ADABAS, VSAM...) to its       0                                          related userviews, if the        0                                          contents of this variable is     0                                          the same in the userview
-DBSYSDIC                          00000+Z0000505830                                          and the masterfile (before       0                                          the change).                     0                                          If the contents was different    0                                          no rippling is performed.        0      15 SAG-PRD-REQUIRED                 The fields which are marked      0                                          with this keywords must be       0                                          filled in all records of
-DBSYSDIC                          00000+Z0000615710                                          this object-type.                0      16 SAG-PRD-SEQ                      Fields with this keyword are     0                                          sequential file attributes.      0      17 SAG-PRD-STD                      Fields with this keyword are     0                                          rippled from a standard          0                                          file to the related field        0                                          in masterfiles (ADABAS,          0                                          VSAM ...).                       0      18 SAG-PRD-UDE                      All fields with this keyword     0                                          deal with user defined entities. 0      19 SAG-PRD-USEREXIT                 for PREDICT user exits           0      20 SAG-PRD-V2                       Fields with this keyword         0                                          are new fields in PREDICT        0                                          Version 2.                       0      21 SAG-PRD-V2-MOD                   Fields with this keyword have    0                                          been changed. Their usage is ex- 0                                          tended in PREDICT Version 2.     0      22 SAG-PRD-V22                      Fields with this key             0                                          are new fields in PREDICT        0                                          Version 2.2.
