-DBEMPLOYEES-FILE                  00000+Z0000015710             ====================================                          0                FILE ADDITIONAL DESCRIPTION                                0             ====================================                          0   *                                                                       0   *****************************************************************       0   DESCRIPTION OF OBJECTS (NO FIELDS) CONTAINED IN THE FILE                0   *****************************************************************       0   *                                                                       0   UNIQUE DESCRIPTION OF EMPLOYEES OF AN INTERN. ENTERPRISE                0   *                                                                       0   *****************************************************************       0   FOR EACH OBJECT THE FOLLOWING INFORMATION                               0       1. PURPOSE DATA IS STORED FOR                                       0       2. WHAT INFORMATION IS STORED (IN GENERAL)                          0       3. WHERE DO DATA COME FROM (IN GENERAL)                             0   ******************************************************************      0   *                                                                       0   1. THE EMPLOYEE DATA MAINTAINED IN THIS FILE APPLIES TO THE MOST        0      IMPORTANT AND MOST FREQUENTLY USED FUNCTIONS OF PERSONNEL            0      ADMINISTRATION WITHIN THE INTERNATIONAL ENTERPRISE AND ITS LOCAL
-DBEMPLOYEES-FILE                  00000+Z0000105830      COMPANIES IN THE VARIOUS COUNTRIES.                                  0      FOR MOST APPLICATIONS THE EMPLOYEE DATA IS THE PRIMARY INFORMATION   0      AND ALL OTHER (VEHICLES) IS DEPENDENT ON IT (COMMON HIERARCHICAL     0      VIEW: FROM PERSON TO VEHICLES)                                       0   *                                                                       0   2. THE EMPLOYEE DATA COVERS ONLY THE MAIN ASPECTS ON                    0      - PERSONAL INFORMATION (NAME, ADDRESS, DATA OF BIRTH ...)
-DBEMPLOYEES-FILE                  00000+Z0000204310      - JOB INFORMATION (POSITION, INCOME, VACATION ...)                   0      - PERSONAL SKILLS (LANGUAGES SPOKEN)                                 0   *                                                                       0   3. THE DATA FOR THIS FILE IS SUPPLIED BY EACH LOCAL COMPANY FOR ITS     0      EMPLOYEES WITHIN THE INTERNATIONAL ENTERPRISE.
