-DBEMPLOYEES-FILE                  09500+Z0000015710             ====================================                          0             ELEM.FIELD ADDITIONAL DESCRIPTION                             0             ====================================                          0   *                                                                       0   *****************************************************************       0   MEANING OF THE FIELD                                                    0   *****************************************************************       0   *                                                                       0   THE INCOME IS MAINTAINED ON A YEARLY BASIS AND COMPOSED OF A FIXED      0   SALARY AND AN OPTIONAL ADDITIONAL BONUS. IT IS A COMPLETE RECORD OF     0   ALL INCOMES OF THE EMPLOYEE  SINCE HE HAS BEEN WORKING WITH THE         0   INTERN. ENTERPRISE. SINCE AN EMPLOYEE CAN CHANGE HIS/HER JOB LOCATION   0   FROM ONE LOCAL TO ANOTHER LOCAL COMPANY WITHIN THE INTERN.ENTERPRISE    0   THE TOTAL INCOME PER YEAR IS MAINTAINED IN THE CORRESPONDING CURRENCY   0   CODE OF THE COMPANY'S COUNTRY THE EMPLOYEE WORKED FOR AT YEARS END.     0   *                                                                       0   *****************************************************************       0   FOR GROUPS: NAME OF FIELDS CONTAINED IN THE GROUP                       0   *****************************************************************       0   *
