-DBVEHICLES-FILE                   00000+Z0000105830      IMPORTANT AND MOST FREQUENTLY USED FUNCTIONS TO ADMINISTER ALL       0      PERSONNEL MATTERS RELATED TO A CAR AND ADMINISTER ALL COMPANY CARS   0      OF THE INTERNATIONAL ENTERPRISE.                                     0      USUALLY CAR INFORMATION IS USED COMING FROM EMPLOYEE DATA.           0   *                                                                       0   2. THE INFORMATION APPLIES TO                                           0      - CAR DESCRIPTION (MAKE, MODEL, COLOR ...)
-DBVEHICLES-FILE                   00000+Z0000204310      - MAINTENANCE DATA (DATE ACQUIRED, MAINTENANCE COSTS ...)            0      - CAR OWNER                                                          0   *                                                                       0   3. THE DATA FOR A VEHICLE IS ENTERED BY THE LOCAL COMPANY WHICH OWNS    0      THE CAR OR TO WHICH THE EMPLOYEE OWNING THE CAR BELONGS TO.
