-DJBILER                           06500+Z0000015710010          ====================================                          0010          ELEM.FIELD ADDITIONAL DESCRIPTION                             0010          ====================================                          0010*                                                                       0010*****************************************************************       0010MEANING OF THE FIELD                                                    0010*****************************************************************       0010*                                                                       0010MAINTENANCE-COSTS OF CARS IN THE CURRENT UNIT OF THE COUNTRY OF         0010THE LOCAL COMPANY AS RECORDED IN CURRENCY-CODE.                         0010*                                                                       0010******************************************************************      0010FOR PE-GROUPS AND MU-FIELDS:                                            0010    1. MEANING OF THE SEQUENCE IN WHICH DATA IS STORED                  0010    2. MEANING AND VALUE OF THE LOWEST AND HIGHEST OCCURRENCE           0010    3. MEANING OF THE OCCURRENCE-COUNTER                                0010    4. WHAT HAPPENS IF THE HIGHEST OCCURENCE HAS BEEN REACHED           0010******************************************************************      0010*                                                                       00101. THE RECORDING SEQUENCE IS IN CHRONOLOGICAL ORDER,
-DJBILER                           06500+Z0000105830010   THE OLDEST PAYMENT FIRST, THE MOST RECENT LAST.                      0010*                                                                       00102. NUMBER OF OCCURRENCES = 0 MEANS, THAT NO MAINTENANCE-COSTS HAVE      0010   OCCURRED FOR THIS PARTICULAR CAR. THIS IS COMMON FOR PRIVATE CARS,   0010   SINCE ONLY IN SPECIAL CASES THE COMPANY IS LIABLE FOR THE            0010   MAINTENANCE OF PRIVATE CARS.                                         0010   NECESSARY PAYMENTS ARE DONE ONCE A MONTH, HENCE A MAXIMAL RECORD
-DJBILER                           06500+Z0000204310010   CAN BE MAINTAINED FOR AT MOST 5 YEARS ( MAX. OCCURRENCE = 60).       0010*                                                                       00103. NUMBER OF PAYMENTS                                                   0010*                                                                       00104. IF MORE THAN 60 PAYMENTS OCCUR THE OLDEST ONE IS DELETED
