-DJVEHICLES                        00000+Z0000015710000          ====================================                          0001             FILE ADDITIONAL DESCRIPTION                                0002          ====================================                          0003*                                                                       0004*****************************************************************       0005DESCRIPTION OF OBJECTS (NOT FIELDS) CONTAINED IN THE FILE               0006*****************************************************************       0007*                                                                       0008UNIQUE DESCRIPTION OF AUTOMOBILES BEING USED BY THE EMPLOYEES           0009OF THE INTERNATIONAL ENTERPRISE AND EITHER OWNED PRIVATELY OR BY        0010THE LOCAL COMPANY.                                                      0011*                                                                       0012*****************************************************************       0013FOR EACH OBJECT THE FOLLOWING INFORMATION IS STORED:                    0014    1. PURPOSE DATA IS STORED FOR                                       0015    2. WHAT INFORMATION IS STORED (IN GENERAL)                          0016    3. WHERE DO DATA COME FROM (IN GENERAL)                             0017*****************************************************************       0018*                                                                       00191. THE VEHICLE DATA MAINTAINED IN THIS FILE APPLIES TO THE MOST
-DJVEHICLES                        00000+Z0000105830020   IMPORTANT AND MOST FREQUENTLY USED FUNCTIONS TO ADMINISTER ALL       0021   PERSONNEL MATTERS RELATED TO A CAR AND ADMINISTER ALL COMPANY CARS   0022   OF THE INTERNATIONAL ENTERPRISE.                                     0023   USUALLY CAR INFORMATION IS USED COMING FROM EMPLOYEE DATA.           0024*                                                                       00252. THE INFORMATION APPLIES TO                                           0026   - CAR DESCRIPTION (MAKE, MODEL, COLOR ...)
-DJVEHICLES                        00000+Z0000206590000   - MAINTENANCE DATA (DATE ACQUIRED, MAINTENANCE COSTS ...)            0001   - CAR OWNER                                                          0002*                                                                       00033. THE DATA FOR A VEHICLE IS ENTERED BY THE LOCAL COMPANY WHICH OWNS    0004   THE CAR OR TO WHICH THE EMPLOYEE OWNING THE CAR BELONGS TO.          0005                                                                        0006                                                                        0007
