-HESAG-PRD-SYS-CONFORM             00000  000000657                                Low-level formatting and DCA  conversion services.          Internally invoked by COMPOSE statement or directly by user program.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                202012100932546000000000000000PRD851                                           000000000000000
-HESAG-PRD-SYS-CONFORM             00000  000010688                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                ZACONFRUN                                                       CONFRUN *SYSSYS*  E0025500255
-HESAG-PRD-SYS-CONFORM             00000  000020359          0006400064CONFRUN                         CONFORMA                        CONFORME                        CONFORMF                        CONFORMM                        CONFORMU                        CONFORMR                        CMPRT33                         CONNECT
-HESAG-PRD-SYS-CONFORM             00000+M000000115SYSDIC-ALLDATA
-HESAG-PRD-SYS-CONFORM             00000+Z0000015710             ====================================                          0               PROGRAM ADDITIONAL DESCRIPTION                              0             ====================================                          0   SYS-CONFORM offers low-level formatting and DCA conversion services.    0   SYS-CONFORM can be invoked explicitly from a user program (NPL only)    0   or can be used implicitly thru the NPL COMPOSE statement or thru the    0   use of 'DEFINE PRINTER' with 'OUTPUT CONNECT'. All entry points of      0   SYS-CONFORM are placed in CONFRUN (rsp. CONFSPO or CONFROOT, depending  0   on the specific environment), but there are internal references to      0   still more load modules and even to the NATURAL nucleus. Refer to       0   the current CON-NECT installation description for a proper setup of     0   the system.                                                             0     Most of the entry points correspond directly to specific              0   subfunctions of the NPL COMPOSE statement:                              0      CONFORMR          RESETTING clause                                   0      CONFORMA          ASSIGNING clause                                   0      CONFORME          EXTRACTING clause                                  0      CONFORMF          FORMATTING clause                                  0      CONFORMM          MOVING clause                                      0      CONFORMU          service ('utility') functions
-HESAG-PRD-SYS-CONFORM             00000+Z0000102030      CMPRT33           support of DEFINE PRINTER .. OUTPUT 'CONNECT'      0      CONNECT           support of DEFINE PRINTER .. OUTPUT 'CONNECT'
