-HNSAG-PRD-SYSHELP                 00000+M000000115SYSDIC-ALLDATA
-HNSAG-PRD-SYSHELP                 00000+Z0000008870001PREDICT's generally-applicable help-facility comprises one subroutine   0002that retrieves help information from the data dictionary (SYSHELP)      0003and 6 help routines that display this help information                  0004(SYSHLP1-SYSHLP6). The library SYSDICH contains all routines.           0005SYSHELP is delivered as a load module to guarantee an upward compatible 0006interface to PREDICT: you can be sure that your help system will        0007continue to work with the same source code when a new version of PREDICT0008is installed. The helproutines are delivered in source form and should  0009be adapted to the user's requirements.                                  0010If problems arise with the USIZE use instead of SYSHELP the subroutine  0011SYSHELP1.
-HMSAG-PRD-SYSHELP-EXAM1           00000  000000657                                This is functional dependent  help information. That means  help for the whole map.       If you enter '?' as field     value you receive more        field dependent help          information. To see how the   universal help is working     please enter '?' for every    field.                                                                                                                                                                                                            202012100932546000000000000000PRD851                                           000000000000000
-HMSAG-PRD-SYSHELP-EXAM1           00000  000010688                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                NA                                                              EXAM1   SYSDICH   M0000000000
