-HNSAG-PRD-U-MODEL                 00000+Z0000015710001          ====================================                          0002            Program additional description                              0003          ====================================                          0004                                                                        0005This userexit is used different for Explode and XREF.                   0006The Local Data Area L-MODEL contains the variables, which will be passed0007                                                                        0008Functionality for Explode:                                              0009                                                                        0010- Processing control                                                    0011                                                                        0012  If #REJECT is set to 'true' within the userexit, no more levels       0013  will be processed for this Object. The program restarts processing    0014  with the next object on the same or on higher level.                  0015                                                                        0016- Output control                                                        0017                                                                        0018  Output can be done by the userexit instead of standard output of      0019  PREDICT or can be done additionaly to the PREDICT output.             0020
